(S, "What is 1 + 2/2?", ["1.5", "2", "3", "2.5"], 1, "Division comes first: 2/2 = 1, so 1 + 1 = 2.", "BODMAS gives division and multiplication priority over addition and subtraction.", [284]),
(S, "What is 1/3 of 20?", ["20/3", "6", "7", "10"], 0, "One third of 20 is 20 divided by 3, which is 20/3 or about 6.67.", "A mixed form of 20/3 is 6 and 2/3.", [858]),
